                                                "sense_id": "2b24cc2b-3f38-31c2-887f-ba4716a3d918",
                                                "text": "If this Coin pass, no Man that lives,\nShall dun for Past Debauches;\nZounds, Landlords, send but in your Wifes,\nWe’ll scow’r off all their Notches."
                                            },
                                            {
